"cues": [
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 3.2,
"end": 6.985,
"text": "Emma's question is now a row of 100 tokens."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 7.287,
"end": 12.36,
"text": "The last one sits at the very end, where the answer is about to begin."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 12.836,
"end": 19.547,
"text": "Before the model writes a word, this last token has to find out which earlier tokens matter."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 20.297,
"end": 24.372,
"text": "Attention gives every token three new vectors."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 24.848,
"end": 27.437,
"text": "A query: what am I looking for?"
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 27.994,
"end": 30.467,
"text": "A key: what do I contain?"
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 30.943,
"end": 35.854,
"text": "And a value: what I will pass on, if I am chosen."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 36.604,
"end": 41.747,
"text": "All three are made from the token's own vector, by three learned matrices."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 42.223,
"end": 47.099,
"text": "In this attention unit, each one is 64 numbers long."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 47.849,
"end": 53.132,
"text": "Now the last token sends out its query, to every key in the row, its own included."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 53.573,
"end": 58.066,
"text": "Multiply query and key, number by number, and add it all up."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 58.669,
"end": 62.466,
"text": "That is a dot product: one score per token."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 62.919,
"end": 66.657,
"text": "When the two point the same way, the score is high."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 67.407,
"end": 72.864,
"text": "Divided by 8, the square root of 64, the scores come out like this."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 73.224,
"end": 76.776,
"text": "Manchester, in Emma's question: 7.8."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 77.334,
"end": 80.677,
"text": "The Manchester in the system prompt: 5.4."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 81.037,
"end": 83.092,
"text": "Stores: 4.5."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 83.348,
"end": 85.519,
"text": "And battery, only 1.4."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 86.076,
"end": 90.07,
"text": "This attention unit is looking for a place, not an item."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 90.82,
"end": 94.802,
"text": "Softmax turns the scores into weights that add up to one."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 95.36,
"end": 100.921,
"text": "Every lead is magnified: 2.4 points ahead becomes ten times the weight."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 101.478,
"end": 104.137,
"text": "Manchester now takes 65 percent."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 104.694,
"end": 107.492,
"text": "The other 99 tokens share the rest."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 108.242,
"end": 109.577,
"text": "Then the values."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 109.937,
"end": 113.339,
"text": "Each one steps forward, scaled by its weight."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 113.896,
"end": 116.532,
"text": "Manchester, at almost full strength."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 116.938,
"end": 118.238,
"text": "The rest, faint."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 118.645,
"end": 123.521,
"text": "Added together, they make one new vector of 64 numbers."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 124.271,
"end": 133.582,
"text": "That new vector goes back to the last token, which now carries what it found: mostly, what Manchester means in this sentence."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 133.942,
"end": 139.817,
"text": "The query asks, the keys answer, and the values are mixed by how well they matched."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 140.223,
"end": 141.965,
"text": "That is attention."
}
]
}